{"topic": "institution characteristics", "review": {"readability_score": 4, "source_accuracy_score": 3, "qualification_retention_score": 3, "unsupported_claims": ["\"Reporting periods across these sources: Academic year 2015-16 through Academic year 2024-25\" implies the sources cover the whole span. Mission statements are listed only for 2015-16 through 2023-24, and directory information is the only source through 2024-25.", "\"Mission statements across several years\" with \"Each year is listed separately\" implies a continuous series. The evidence has no 2024-25 mission table, and the 2016-17, 2019-20 and 2020-21 through 2023-24 tables are separate groupings. The candidate also never says which years are covered.", "\"Each year is listed separately\" is not accurate for the draft itself. The candidate lists no individual years, and the source groups 2015-16, 2017-18 and 2018-19 together as one series.", "The \"too long to enter\" description of the mission statement URL comes from variable definitions that were not cited. The draft cites only table-level quotes for the mission topics."], "missing_qualifications": ["The mission statement table periods are omitted: 2015-16 to 2023-24, with no 2024-25. The candidate gives only the generic \"Coverage varies by measure\".", "The candidate does not say that directory information is the only area covering 2015-16 through 2024-25, and that 2024-25 is provisional.", "The candidate drops the template's statement that these are codebook and physical-table matches, not confirmation that institutions reported values.", "The candidate drops that definitions, populations and available breakdowns can differ by year.", "The candidate omits the structural reason the mission statement series are split: the table structures or definitions differ."], "comments": ["The candidate is concise and clear, and the three required qualifications appear nearly verbatim.", "The directory description is supported by the cited quotes: names, cities, websites, sector, and control and level. The \"other descriptive fields\" wording is loosely supported by the table definition.", "The main weakness is the single blended period range, which overstates uniform coverage. Moving the exact years to Definitions & sources is acceptable, but the narrative should not imply equal coverage for both areas."]}}
